WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.831
This is Trade Helper, a free learning
aid for the Dhaka Stock Exchange.

2
00:00:05.871 --> 00:00:09.960
Let us use it like a new investor.

3
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:14.321
Type a code or a name in
the search box at the top.

4
00:00:14.361 --> 00:00:19.961
We type G P and open Grameenphone.

5
00:00:20.801 --> 00:00:27.961
Each company starts with a signal, and
a plain suggestion in everyday words.

6
00:00:28.801 --> 00:00:31.278
Four quick questions follow.

7
00:00:31.318 --> 00:00:33.260
Is it a good business?

8
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.662
Is it cheap?

9
00:00:34.702 --> 00:00:36.610
Any warning signs?

10
00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:38.961
A dividend coming?

11
00:00:39.801 --> 00:00:42.173
The tabs hold the details.

12
00:00:42.213 --> 00:00:44.980
Price history shows the last year.

13
00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:47.961
Hover the line to see each day.

14
00:00:48.802 --> 00:00:52.254
Press Save to watchlist to
keep an eye on a company.

15
00:00:52.294 --> 00:00:55.962
It now shows in your Watchlist.

16
00:00:56.802 --> 00:01:00.741
Plan a buy works out how
many shares a budget covers.

17
00:01:00.781 --> 00:01:07.962
We type ten thousand
taka and press Plan it.

18
00:01:08.803 --> 00:01:12.766
Save as plan keeps it, with
a target price and a date.

19
00:01:12.806 --> 00:01:16.963
The plan is saved.

20
00:01:17.803 --> 00:01:21.417
Compare with others puts
companies side by side.

21
00:01:21.457 --> 00:01:28.963
We add Robi, to compare
it with Grameenphone.

22
00:01:29.804 --> 00:01:35.183
The 52 week range page shows each
price between its yearly low and high.

23
00:01:35.223 --> 00:01:40.964
We tap My watchlist to
see only our companies.

24
00:01:41.805 --> 00:01:44.839
Under My rules, you set your own rule.

25
00:01:44.879 --> 00:01:53.967
We choose Near its low, within
ten percent, and press Add rule.

26
00:01:54.807 --> 00:01:57.574
Portfolio tracks what you own.

27
00:01:57.614 --> 00:02:01.968
Open Add or import trades.

28
00:02:02.808 --> 00:02:08.361
We enter a made up trade: ten G P
shares at two hundred fifty taka.

29
00:02:08.401 --> 00:02:14.969
Then press Add trade.

30
00:02:15.809 --> 00:02:23.969
Holdings now shows ten G P shares, with
the value today and the profit or loss.

31
00:02:24.809 --> 00:02:27.959
Buy plans lists the plan we saved.

32
00:02:27.999 --> 00:02:31.970
It turns green at the target price.

33
00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:35.449
Alerts watches prices for you.

34
00:02:35.489 --> 00:02:45.970
We add a rule: tell me when G P is
at or below two hundred forty taka.

35
00:02:46.811 --> 00:02:52.973
The rule is checked while the
site is open in this browser.

36
00:02:53.813 --> 00:02:57.567
Sign in with Google to keep your
data in your own Google Sheet.

37
00:02:57.607 --> 00:03:01.973
This is the signed in view.

38
00:03:02.813 --> 00:03:06.300
Connect Telegram to get
the alerts on your phone.

39
00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:12.973
Scan the code with your
phone camera, then tap Start.

40
00:03:13.813 --> 00:03:23.673
The globe button switches the
whole site to Bangla, and back.

41
00:03:24.513 --> 00:03:33.956
The menu also has warning signs, a signal
scorecard, and plain guides for beginners.

42
00:03:34.796 --> 00:03:36.135
New here?

43
00:03:36.175 --> 00:03:42.957
The Help page has a short welcome guide.

44
00:03:43.797 --> 00:03:50.958
It also has this video, and a
guide you can download as a PDF.

45
00:03:51.799 --> 00:03:53.207
Trade Helper.

46
00:03:53.247 --> 00:03:57.960
Learning aid, not investment advice.

